<sync start=16950><p class=99LRC><font color=#C0C0C0>because she has booked a sightseeing trip.</font><br><font color=#0080FF>　　　The girl looks happy but her aged mother disappointed.</font>
<sync start=20230><p class=99LRC><font color=#0080FF>It goes without saying that this cartoon mirrors the relationship</font><br><font color=#C0C0C0>　　　between adult children and their elderly parents.</font>
<sync start=24820><p class=99LRC><font color=#C0C0C0>It goes without saying that this cartoon mirrors the relationship</font><br><font color=#0080FF>　　　between adult children and their elderly parents.</font>
<sync start=28540><p class=99LRC><font color=#0080FF>Nowadays, the increasingly fierce competition compels people to</font><br><font color=#C0C0C0>　　　make every effort to work. And they make use of their precious spare time</font>
<sync start=34230><p class=99LRC><font color=#C0C0C0>Nowadays, the increasingly fierce competition compels people to</font><br><font color=#0080FF>　　　make every effort to work. And they make use of their precious spare time</font>
<sync start=38930><p class=99LRC><font color=#0080FF>to entertain themselves as an escape from stressful reality.</font><br><font color=#C0C0C0>　　　Therefore, they practically have no time to spend together with their parents.</font>
<sync start=43300><p class=99LRC><font color=#C0C0C0>to entertain themselves as an escape from stressful reality.</font><br><font color=#0080FF>　　　Therefore, they practically have no time to spend together with their parents.</font>
<sync start=48780><p class=99LRC><font color=#0080FF>The aged parents, on the other hand,</font><br><font color=#C0C0C0>　　　overwhelmed by a vacuum when they retire from their jobs,</font>
<sync start=51290><p class=99LRC><font color=#C0C0C0>The aged parents, on the other hand,</font><br><font color=#0080FF>　　　overwhelmed by a vacuum when they retire from their jobs,</font>
<sync start=55330><p class=99LRC><font color=#0080FF>have nothing to do but long for their children to come back.</font><br><font color=#C0C0C0>　　　As far as I can see,</font>
<sync start=59380><p class=99LRC><font color=#C0C0C0>have nothing to do but long for their children to come back.</font><br><font color=#0080FF>　　　As far as I can see,</font>
<sync start=61350><p class=99LRC><font color=#0080FF>the quality of the relationship between parents and children</font><br><font color=#C0C0C0>　　　is of supreme significance.</font>
<sync start=64850><p class=99LRC><font color=#C0C0C0>the quality of the relationship between parents and children</font><br><font color=#0080FF>　　　is of supreme significance.</font>
<sync start=67480><p class=99LRC><font color=#0080FF>It is also important that parents feel happy in the knowledge that they are loved.</font><br><font color=#C0C0C0>　　　That is to say, children need to spend more time with their parents</font>
<sync start=72830><p class=99LRC><font color=#C0C0C0>It is also important that parents feel happy in the knowledge that they are loved.</font><br><font color=#0080FF>　　　That is to say, children need to spend more time with their parents</font>
<sync start=77320><p class=99LRC><font color=#0080FF>and express love and concern about them.</font><br><font color=#C0C0C0>　　　In addition, it is advisable for the parents to accept the fact that</font>
<sync start=80270><p class=99LRC><font color=#C0C0C0>and express love and concern about them.</font><br><font color=#0080FF>　　　In addition, it is advisable for the parents to accept the fact that</font>
<sync start=85520><p class=99LRC><font color=#0080FF>sooner or later their children will leave them for an independent life.</font><br><font color=#C0C0C0>　　　By looking for social circles of their own and cultivating hobbies</font>
<sync start=90220><p class=99LRC><font color=#C0C0C0>sooner or later their children will leave them for an independent life.</font><br><font color=#0080FF>　　　By looking for social circles of their own and cultivating hobbies</font>
<sync start=94820><p class=99LRC><font color=#0080FF>such as writing, painting and singing, elderly parents</font><br><font color=#C0C0C0>　　　will enjoy a more meaningful life in their remaining years.</font>
